[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0219","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0219.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"大华智能物联综合管理平台 ICC 多个接口远程代码执行漏洞","description":"大华智能物联综合管理平台 ICC 的 /evo-runs/v1.0/ 及 /evo-apigw/admin/ 等接口存在远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过向受影响接口发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大华 ICC 系列产品，攻击者可利用该漏洞完全控制目标服务器，危害严重。建议联系厂商获取安全补丁或临时限制受影响接口仅允许内网管理 IP 访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-0541a28b"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"联系大华厂商获取官方安全补丁并升级至最新版本；临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上限制 /evo-runs/v1.0/ 和 /evo-apigw/admin/ 接口仅允许内网管理 IP 访问，部署 WAF 拦截远程代码执行特征 payload，并启用 API 异常调用日志监控加强对 /evo-runs/ 和 /evo-apigw/ 路径的访问审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0193","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0193.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"汉王e脸通综合管理平台任意文件上传漏洞","description":"汉王e脸通综合管理平台 uploadMapFile.do 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞，由于未对上传文件类型进行有效的白名单校验，未授权的远程攻击者可通过构造特制 HTTP 请求直接上传恶意的 JSP 脚本文件，获取服务器 WebShell 权限，进而执行任意系统命令、窃取敏感数据或横向攻击内网。该漏洞影响汉王e脸通综合管理平台多个版本，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-03cfaf11"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"对 uploadMapFile.do 接口添加文件类型白名单校验，仅允许图片类型文件上传；禁用 JSP 目录的写入执行权限；限制该接口仅允许内网 IP 访问；部署 WAF 规则拦截文件上传请求中的恶意脚本内容；定期审计服务器上传目录中的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T13:38:59Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0178","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0178.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"易宇通 KingTrans 物流管理系统 SQL注入漏洞","description":"易宇通 KingTrans 物流管理系统的 getAccountTypeByNumber 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞，由于未对 number 参数进行充分过滤和参数化查询，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 SQL 语句注入到后端数据库，导致数据库中的用户信息、物流订单等敏感数据被非法窃取或篡改。该漏洞影响 KingTrans 物流管理系统的多个版本，攻击者可利用该接口在公网直接进行探测利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-02cdc347"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在代码层面对 number 参数改为预编译/参数化查询并做白名单校验，禁止拼接 SQL；将该接口限制为仅内网或 VPN 可访问，并在前置 WAF/网关拦截 union/select/sleep 等 SQL 注入特征作为临时缓解措施。联系易宇通厂商获取安全补丁或升级至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0164","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0164.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"某产品存在安全漏洞允许远程攻击","description":"某产品存在安全漏洞，攻击者可利用该漏洞造成信息泄露或拒绝服务，影响系统正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-01fe5e9d"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T17:21:40Z","remediation":"厂商已发布安全更新，请升级至最新版本以修复漏洞。建议用户及时更新并做好访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T17:21:40Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0155","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0155.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"捷顺 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"捷顺 JieLink+ 智能终端操作平台存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向 deviceId 参数构造恶意 SQL 语句，绕过身份认证获取数据库敏感信息或执行任意 SQL 命令。该漏洞影响相关平台的多个版本，攻击条件低，无需高级权限即可远程利用，危害较大。建议用户联系厂商获取安全补丁，对 deviceId 参数实施参数化查询，并限制相关接口仅允许内网访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-01a467be"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"对所有输入参数（尤其是 deviceId）实施参数化查询或预编译语句，禁止拼接 SQL 语句；限制该接口仅允许可信内网 IP 访问；部署 WAF 规则拦截 SQL 注入攻击特征，如检测单引号、恒真条件等常见注入载荷；联系捷顺厂商获取最新安全补丁并升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0141","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0141.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 中存在认证绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过向 UDP 12346 端口发送特制报文绕过身份验证机制，未授权访问控制器管理接口，进而获取设备配置信息并可能进一步控制受影响设备，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-00add8b5"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Controller 20.19.1 及以上版本，同时在网络边界防火墙上禁止 UDP 12346 端口对外暴露，限制管理接口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T16:18:29Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0266","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-40187","title":"EGroupware eTemplate 认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EGroupware 存在经认证的远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者以管理员身份登录后，可通过上传恶意的 eTemplate XML 文件（.xet）到 VFS 的 /etemplates 目录触发该漏洞。漏洞根因在于 Widget::expand_name() 方法将模板控件属性值直接传入 PHP eval() 函数执行，且仅对双引号进行了转义，未对反引号做任何过滤。在 PHP 中，eval() 字符串内的反引号会被当作 shell 命令执行，导致攻击者可从 Web 应用权限提升至服务器操作系统级任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 26.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。官方 Docker 部署因配置了 disable_functions 限制不受影响，但裸机、虚拟机或未加固的容器部署均存在风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-40187","GHSA-8737-2x9g-xjj7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T17:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-20T18:16:51Z","remediation":"tags as required by the specification.<value>立即将 EGroupware 升级至 26.4.20260413（主版本线）或 23.1.20260601（旧版线）及以上版本，修复 Widget::expand_name() 中 eval() 反引号未转义问题。如无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 disable_functions = shell_exec,exec,passthru,system,proc_open,popen 以阻断反引符执行系统命令；Docker 官方部署默认已含此加固配置，需确保未被移除或覆盖。同时严格限制管理员账号仅授予可信任人员。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-8737-2x9g-xjj7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-40187.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-40187.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/40xxx/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/egroupware/egroupware/CVE-2026-40187.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/234f830f64cdc68cb0704070f7453dab13cb7503/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-40187/README.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-40187-egroupware-has-authenticated-rce-via-malicious-etemplate-upload.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/a764a3a240add0279626a01e6510fa9b627353f4/posts/cve-2026-40187-composer-egroupware-egroupware.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-40187.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-40187.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0696","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0696.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46428","title":"lettre SMTP 库 TLS 主机名验证被禁用漏洞","description":"Rust 邮件库 lettre 的 `boring-tls` 后端存在布尔值反转的逻辑错误，导致在调用方使用默认严格配置（未显式启用 `accept_invalid_hostnames`）时，TLS 主机名验证被 silently 关闭。由于 `TlsParametersBuilder` 将 `accept_invalid_hostnames` 标志原样传递给 booring 的 `set_verify_hostname`，导致语义反转：严格模式下本应进行主机名校验，实际却被跳过。影响范围为启用 `boring-tls` 特性的所有 lettre 用户（v0.10.1 至 v0.11.21），`native-tls` 与 `rustls` 后端不受影响。攻击条件要求攻击者位于 lettre 客户端与目标 SMTP 服务器之间的网络路径上（on-path attacker）。利用方式：攻击者持有任意通过信任链的 TLS 证书（如自主域名的 Let's Encrypt 证书），在 SMTP STARTTLS 或隐式 TLS 握手时向客户端提交该证书，lettre 会错误通过主机名校验并继续 SMTP 通信，导致 SMTP 认证凭据（PLAIN/LOGIN/CRAM-MD5）、邮件正文及附件被中间人完整窃取或篡改。 CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重，建议升级至 v0.11.22 修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46428","GHSA-4pj9-g833-qx53"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T16:17:01Z","updated":"2026-07-23T17:58:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 lettre 库至 v0.11.22 或更高版本，该版本已修复 boring-tls 集成中导致 TLS 主机名验证被禁用的布尔值反转漏洞。若暂时无法升级，建议在编译时移除 boring-tls 特性，改用不受影响的 native-tls 或 rustls 后端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lettre/lettre/commit/f5efffc88360dbdbfcef80f465e42d5bce68ca35","https://github.com/lettre/lettre/releases/tag/v0.11.22","https://github.com/lettre/lettre/security/advisories/GHSA-4pj9-g833-qx53","https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0141.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2026/CVE-2026-46428.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2026/46xxx/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2026/46xxx/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-46428.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/be745c1ea7b9b91e65f3d64ef3f756698bb41557/data/2026/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-46428.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/6dd9892dd68397ee98232ad0e1fed55a1599cf70/reports/2026-07-20/TIER_3_CVE-2026-46428.md","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-46428.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0696.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0256","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27823","title":"EGroupware 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EGroupware 存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于不正确的授权检查机制（CWE-285），结合文件写入原语和任意文件读取漏洞，使得经过身份认证的攻击者能够在服务器上执行任意命令。若系统启用了用户自助注册功能，则攻击者可在无需预先认证的情况下利用该漏洞，实现完全的系统控制。该漏洞影响 EGroupware 多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。厂商已在 26.2.20260224 及 23.1.20260224 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27823","GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T16:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-21T16:17:07Z","remediation":"立即将 EGroupware 升级到 26.2.20260224（26.x 分支）或 23.1.20260224（23.x 分支）及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在管理后台关闭用户自助注册功能（user self-registration），并在 Web 服务器层面限制对 index.php 中 importexport_export_ui.download 及 SmallParT 相关端点的非授权访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EGroupware/egroupware/security/advisories/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/egroupware/egroupware/CVE-2026-27823.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/62f018f20b9d742e5172b0bfe0117dd1e316969c/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-27823-egroupware-has-a-remote-code-execution-vulnerability.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p/GHSA-h9qx-v5xp-ph8p.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27823.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27823.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/95b903de754cd34d47ddff19406c10a874de7522/reports/2026/07/intel--45640a2df63dac0c.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0806","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54910","title":"FileBrowser Quantum 路径遍历漏洞","description":"FileBrowser Quantum 的 `subtitlesHandler` 接口（`GET /api/media/subtitles`）存在两个独立的路径遍历向量。主要向量为 `path` 参数：未调用 `SanitizeUserPath()` 直接传入 `idx.GetRealPath()`，攻击者可通过 `path=../../etc/passwd` 逃逸存储根目录，无需锚点文件即可将 `parentDir` 设为宿主任意目录。次要向量为 `name` 参数：直接与 `parentDir` 经 `filepath.Join()` 拼接且未去除目录分量，配合有效锚点文件可实现相对路径遍历。任意已认证用户（无需特殊权限）均可利用任一向量读取服务器进程可读的任意文本文件（UTF-8 编码、<50MB），包括 `/etc/passwd`、SSH 私钥、数据库凭据、JWT 签名密钥等敏感信息。受影响版本为 1.4.3-beta 之前，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.7（HIGH），已在 1.4.3-beta 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54910","GHSA-vvp7-h4fj-m28w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-20T15:16:43Z","updated":"2026-07-23T17:58:34Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 FileBrowser Quantum 到 1.4.3-beta 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理层面拦截 `/api/media/subtitles` 端点中包含 `..` 路径遍历字符的 `path` 和 `name` 参数请求，或临时禁用字幕功能端点作为缓解措施。部署时建议以最小权限运行容器，避免以 root 身份启动以降低凭证泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/commit/f3f4bbe80cb569d664174aea874d7bfa008c3b5a","https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser/security/advisories/GHSA-vvp7-h4fj-m28w","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-54910.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54910.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-549xx/CVE-2026-54910.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-54910.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0245","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-16221","title":"fast-uri 主机混淆漏洞（反斜杠权限定符解析差异导致 SSRF 绕过）","description":"fast-uri 是 Node.js 生态中广泛使用的 URL 解析库，其 2.3.1 至 4.1.0 版本存在主机混淆漏洞。该漏洞源于 fast-uri 未将反斜杠字符（U+005C）视为 authority 分隔符，而 Node.js 原生的 WHATWG URL 解析器（被 fetch、undici 及 http/https 客户端使用）会将特殊协议（http/https/ws/wss/ftp/file）中的反斜杠标准化为斜杠。攻击者可构造形如 `http://evil.com\\@allowed.com` 的恶意 URL，使 fast-uri 解析出 `allowed.com` 作为目标主机，而 Node.js 实际请求 `evil.com`，从而绕过基于主机的白名单、黑名单、SSRF 过滤、重定向验证或出站代理路由策略，将请求劫持到云元数据端点、回环地址或内部网络主机。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-16221","GHSA-v2hh-gcrm-f6hx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-19T15:16:49Z","updated":"2026-07-21T18:31:51Z","remediation":"将 fast-uri 升级到 4.1.1, 3.1.4 或 2.4.3 及以上版本（根据当前使用的 major 版本选择对应分支），即可修复此主机混淆漏洞。由于无临时的缓解措施可用，应优先安排升级并重新测试依赖该库的 URL 校验逻辑。运行 `npm update fast-uri` 或修改 package.json 中 fast-uri 的版本号后执行 `npm install`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/security/advisories/GHSA-v2hh-gcrm-f6hx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-19/TIER_2_CVE-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/fast-uri/CVE-2026-16221.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-16221","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/16xxx/CVE-2026-16221.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/50fdfc605f6e626e4cc9d8c6ab46b2329edadea9/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-16221.md","https://github.com/epam/ai-dial-admin-frontend/blob/df71c07f4b4826014f09c70b62d0d3f780cf8637/.trivyignore","https://github.com/archestra-ai/archestra/blob/2d8c4fe06aee1b22314ad815f424881cfb3cd4c1/platform/pnpm-workspace.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0245.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0245.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0515","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54335","title":"Feathersjs @feathersjs/commons 原型污染漏洞","description":"`@feathersjs/commons` 工具库中的 `_.merge` 函数存在原型污染漏洞。当通过 `JSON.parse` 解析的输入包含 `__proto__`、`constructor` 或 `prototype` 键时，递归合并操作会将攻击者控制的属性写入 `Object.prototype`，从而污染 Node.js 进程中所有普通对象的原型链。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低，实际利用条件苛刻——需要下游插件或应用将 JSON 解析后的不可信输入直接传入 `_.merge`。已在 `@feathersjs/commons@5.0.45` 中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54335","GHSA-28xv-ph75-77wh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T22:17:44Z","updated":"2026-07-23T17:58:34Z","remediation":"将 @feathersjs/commons 升级至 5.0.45 及以上版本，该版本已跳过 __proto__、constructor 和 prototype 键的迭代合并。如无法立即升级，避免将 JSON.parse 解析的不可信输入传入 commons._.merge 方法，或在上游对输入键名进行校验过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/feathersjs/feathers/commit/28b3c03c63bdbff53115fdaa46c56980e7942acc","https://github.com/feathersjs/feathers/pull/3690","https://github.com/feathersjs/feathers/releases/tag/v5.0.45","https://github.com/feathersjs/feathers/security/advisories/GHSA-28xv-ph75-77wh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54335.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/@feathersjs/commons/CVE-2026-54335.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54335.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54335.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54335.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-28xv-ph75-77wh/GHSA-28xv-ph75-77wh.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54335.json","https://github.com/anchore/vulnerability-index-spec-files/blob/124f9dd88ae3210967065ab152ac9debdc2e3709/data/2026/53/ANCHORE-2026-53317.toml","https://github.com/slowslowgogo/SecurityReport/blob/9c2fe25b94c7c3f24908c5b82631ca477488eb4f/output/brief_2026-07-18.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0f0b9d6a392d0d58ac48900af57e1d0e8f253633/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-543xx/CVE-2026-54335.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0315","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49485","title":"HL7 FHIR Core FHIRPathEngine 正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HAPI FHIR 的 FHIRPathEngine 实现中存在正则表达式拒绝服务（ReDoS）漏洞。FHIRPathEngine 接受任意 FHIRPath 表达式且未做输入验证，其 matches()、matchesFull() 和 replaceMatches() 函数将用户可控的正则表达式传递给 Java 的 Pattern.compile() 和 String.replaceAll()，但超时机制存在缺陷——仅取消了执行线程却无法终止线程内的正则运算。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 FHIR Validator HTTP 端点发送包含恶意正则模式（如 (a+)+$）的资源，触发 Java 正则引擎的指数级回溯（O(2^n) 时间复杂度），导致 CPU 资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 6.9.9 和 6.9.4.2 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49485","GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T22:17:16Z","updated":"2026-07-20T15:16:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 org.hl7.fhir.core 至 6.9.9 或 6.9.4.2 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复 FHIRPathEngine 中 matches()/replaceMatches() 的正则回溯问题。如无法立即升级，可在 FHIR Validator HTTP 端点入口处增加输入校验，限制 FHIRPath 表达式的来源为可信用户，并在网关层对 /fhir 路径设置请求频率限制和超时阈值以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/commit/109c88837c032ef399b2eb87ddde86692065cf41","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/commit/e08982d2b6f6dcd6c670a762d9cf999179fbe4ed","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/pull/2463","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/releases/tag/6.9.4.2","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/releases/tag/6.9.9","https://github.com/hapifhir/org.hl7.fhir.core/security/advisories/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/ca.uhn.hapi.fhir/org.hl7.fhir.r4/CVE-2026-49485.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49485.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3f9f364bccc73ba3de8be88b66bacb6688594e5b/posts/cve-2026-49485-maven-ca-uhn-hapi-fhir-org-hl7-fhir-dstu2.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49485.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2dd0160b9ec0105216522022a89e49e69be74f7e/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv/GHSA-7cmj-v6x8-frvv.json","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-49485.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0563","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54498","title":"ViewComponent view_component around_render HTML安全绕过跨站脚本漏洞","description":"ViewComponent 是 Ruby on Rails 中用于构建可复用、可测试视图组件的框架。其 `ViewComponent::Base#around_render` 方法存在 HTML 安全绕过漏洞（CWE-79），当 `around_render` 返回包含用户可控数据的字符串时，会绕过正常 `#call` 方法的转义机制，直接输出原始 HTML，导致跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。攻击者可在低权限条件下，通过构造恶意载荷触发 XSS，窃取会话凭证、执行越权操作或进行钓鱼攻击。`ViewComponent::Collection#render_in` 会进一步放大风险，将各条目结果拼接后标记为 `html_safe`，使未转义的恶意内容被浏览器直接执行。该漏洞影响 ViewComponent 4.0.0 至 4.12.0 版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。官方已在 4.12.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54498","GHSA-97jw-64cj-jc58"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:04:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 ViewComponent 至 v4.12.0 或更高版本（执行 `bundle update view_component`），该版本已修复 `around_render` 的 HTML 安全绕过问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在 `around_render` 中返回用户可控内容，并对返回值手动调用 `ERB::Util.html_escape` 进行转义处理；同时避免在集合渲染中使用 `.html_safe` 拼接未经过安全边界的组件输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/commit/48e5fd2d602344c7d33019fbc5c8b087e315bb78","https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/commit/6796b2e89d0bd7b9d7d763a86275e5334731dd61","https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/releases/tag/v4.12.0","https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/security/advisories/GHSA-97jw-64cj-jc58","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/view_component/CVE-2026-54498.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54498.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54498.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54498.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54498.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-04-CVE-2026-54498.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2026/CVE-2026-54498/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-54498.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/61b6c11d066bdf8e461d32b8d1b1447a9b607b34/cve/CVE-2026-54498.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-97jw-64cj-jc58/GHSA-97jw-64cj-jc58.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0563.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0562","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54497","title":"ViewComponent view_component 组件实例复用导致渲染上下文污染漏洞","description":"ViewComponent 是 Ruby on Rails 中用于构建可复用视图组件的框架，其 4.0.0 至 4.12.0 版本存在渲染上下文残留漏洞。ViewComponent::Base 实例在多次调用 render_in 时保留了渲染作用域对象（如 helpers、controller、request、view_flow 等），当同一组件、集合或间隔组件实例在跨请求、跨用户、跨租户或跨线程场景下被复用时，后续渲染会使用前次渲染的过期上下文。攻击者可通过构造特定请求触发组件复用，导致权限感知组件向低权限用户渲染特权 UI、生成包含过期 Host 头的链接、泄露插槽/辅助方法状态，并在并发渲染场景下混入请求上下文。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危，影响所有使用 ViewComponent 且存在组件实例复用模式的 Rails 应用。官方已在 4.12.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54497","GHSA-9h85-g7w3-rh49"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:20:01Z","remediation":"立即将 view_component gem 升级至 4.12.0 或更高版本（`bundle update view_component`）。如无法升级，避免跨请求/线程复用同一组件实例，确保每次渲染使用 `MyComponent.new` 创建新实例，不在常量、单例或缓存中存储已实例化的组件对象。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/commit/6796b2e89d0bd7b9d7d763a86275e5334731dd61","https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/releases/tag/v4.12.0","https://github.com/ViewComponent/view_component/security/advisories/GHSA-9h85-g7w3-rh49","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/view_component/CVE-2026-54497.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54497.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54497.md","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-04-CVE-2026-54497.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54497.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-54497.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/61b6c11d066bdf8e461d32b8d1b1447a9b607b34/cve/CVE-2026-54497.html","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/view_component/CVE-2026-54497.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9h85-g7w3-rh49/GHSA-9h85-g7w3-rh49.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54497.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0562.toml"}]